# Torpor Orb stops only creatures entering from causing triggers, whatever the trigger asks for (the rulings' Captain
# Storm / Contraband Kingpin): Tezzeret, Cruel Captain's "Whenever an artifact you control enters, put a loyalty counter"
# does not trigger for Ornithopter, an artifact creature, but does for Mind Stone and for the Clue Tireless Tracker's
# landfall makes, noncreature artifacts. Bot2's Orb stops Bot1's triggers as well as its own. Tezzeret enters with 4;
# Mox Sapphire, cast on turn 1 before the Orb, adds one (5), Mind Stone one (6), the Clue one (7).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sol Ring
Tezzeret, Cruel Captain
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Tireless Tracker
Mind Stone
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Torpor Orb
Island x12

