Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tezzeret, Cruel Captain.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tezzeret, Cruel Captain.Counters.Loyalty = 5
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Torpor Orb.Cast
