Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tireless Tracker.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tezzeret, Cruel Captain.Counters.Loyalty = 6
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

